"b-bcea28104da5da28be82","layer":"original","quote":"奕改姓名，微服还本郡","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-68d4c3969b8cc9f1bf2d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-29ff9d47d7f84d4c5f69","layer":"pei","quote":"奕无子，诏以其族子统，为郎，以奉奕后","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4d5b4a20ef10d7696ad2","start":31,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-7c8ab1f03ec69142df89","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-bcea28104da5da28be82","layer":"original","quote":"避难江东，孙策礼命之","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-8fd4808d2660c994efd7","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2e3d13b9c0739908e8a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖乃以奕为中尉，手令曰：“昔楚有子玉〖5〗，文公为之侧席而坐〖6〗；汲黯在朝〖7〗，淮南为之折谋〖8〗。《诗》称‘邦之司直’，君之谓与","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-aef71fd078e809554b66","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-6c778cf54c0f22a327b0","layer":"pei","quote":"或谓奕曰：‘夫以史鱼之直，孰与蘧伯玉之智？丁仪方贵重，宜思所以下之。’奕曰：‘以公明圣，仪岂得久行其伪乎！且奸以事君者，吾所能御也。子宁以他规我","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c3116d0d2e2506eb32b","start":10,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b2a734b1eb1d9b8f59b5","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-744efc38dc3e2f2fb8f8","layer":"original","quote":"魏国初建，拜尚书","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b4c9a17a0d2dac2e0b22","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b98fdf30cfe006001885","layer":"original","quote":"太祖叹曰：“讽所以敢生乱心，以吾爪牙之臣无遏奸防谋者故也。安得如诸葛丰者〖4〗，使代俊乎？”桓阶曰：“徐奕其人也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-db2ebd12ac1479f03092","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ecadc2b94d58e0bc3ac4","layer":"pei","quote":"从破马超等，子伯功为多。曹公常叹曰：‘子伯之计，孤不及也","attribution":"裴注·《吴书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4d3d422b1c33b802fc46","start":363,"end":391,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e7f6adbb17dff9a8034f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2e3d13b9c0739908e8a","layer":"original","quote":"在职数月，疾笃，乞退","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":70,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e8747363f0c037fe831e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cd085f0bc2343b371c06","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征孙权，徙为留府长史，谓奕曰：“君之忠亮，古人不过也！然微太严。昔西门豹佩韦以自缓〖2〗；夫能以柔弱制刚强者，望之于君也。今使君统留事，孤无复还顾之忧也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-3187f9e926f737afca24","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cd085f0bc2343b371c06","layer":"original","quote":"太祖为司空，辟为掾属，从西征马超。超破，军还。时关中新服，未甚安。留奕为丞相长史，镇抚西京；西京称其威信。转为雍州刺史。复还为东曹属。丁仪等见宠于时，并害之，而奕终不为动。﹝一﹞出为魏郡太守。太祖征孙权，徙为留府长史，谓奕曰：“君之忠亮，古人不过也！然微太严。昔西门豹佩韦以自缓〖2〗；夫能以柔弱制刚强者，望之于君也。今使君统留事，孤无复还顾之忧也！”","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-fb0fc958db13a49bfe01","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b98fdf30cfe006001885","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，为尚书，复典选举。迁尚书令。太祖征汉中，魏讽等谋反，中尉杨俊左迁〖3〗。太祖叹曰：“讽所以敢生乱心，以吾爪牙之臣无遏奸防谋者故也。安得如诸葛丰者〖4〗，使代俊乎？”桓阶曰：“徐奕其人也。”","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-01fca3bdbcbaaa53a0c6","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-fde3ea16fb0f48bf4083","layer":"original","quote":"又毛玠、徐奕以刚謇少党〖7〗，而为西曹掾丁仪所不善〖8〗；仪屡言其短，赖阶左右以自全保〖9〗。其将顺匡救，多此类也","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1c8aa779ac389f7303e7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dfd76f5cb0dc84d92f59","layer":"original","quote":"后超反，既从太祖破超于华阴","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-52876f56216b11500e33","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖破超于渭南，德随超亡入汉阳，保冀城","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":193,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-e521121329ff29a1cea8","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2791e4960695e3d97a40","layer":"original","quote":"后数日会战，大破超等，褚身斩首级","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":99,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-p008","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5476707ed7cc1389d719","layer":"pei","quote":"丁亥令曰：“故尚书仆射毛玠，奉常王修、凉茂，郎中令袁涣，少府谢奂、万潜，中尉徐奕、国渊等，皆忠直在朝，履蹈仁义；并早即世，而子孙陵迟，恻然愍之。其皆拜子男为郎中。”","attribution":"裴注·魏书续引","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2a980d42bd6d8f9a3005","start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o132b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0f9191c7bec5bbb7c81","layer":"original","quote":"公乃与克日会战〖14〗，先以轻兵挑之。战良久，乃纵虎骑夹击〖15〗；大破之，斩成宜、李堪等。遂、超等走凉州〖16〗，杨秋奔安定〖17〗，关中平。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":237,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗十八年：建安十八年（公元 213）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bec99dfe67d67ae54b06","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d44820525c4645832365","layer":"original","quote":"十八年春正月〖11〗，进军濡须口〖12〗；攻破权江西营，获权都督公孙阳〖13〗，乃引军还。诏书并十四州〖14〗，复为九州〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p115","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
